[I] D-Bus service to check dual-GPU hybrid graphics availability

[T] switcheroo-control is a small D-Bus service that lets desktop shells and
[T] applications query whether a machine has hybrid (dual-GPU) graphics
[T] available, so they can offer launching applications on the discrete GPU
[T] without users having to set environment variables by hand.

[U] https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/hadess/switcheroo-control

